### Nearby open help requests
GET {{host}}/api/help-requests/nearby?lat=50.0614&lng=19.9366&radiusKm=4

### Open help requests along the Krakow demo commute route
POST {{host}}/api/help-requests/along-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": [
    { "lat": 50.0541, "lng": 19.9272 },
    { "lat": 50.0585, "lng": 19.9385 },
    { "lat": 50.0647, "lng": 19.945 },
    { "lat": 50.0709, "lng": 19.9561 }
  ],
  "bufferMeters": 450
}

### Invalid route: route requires at least two points
POST {{host}}/api/help-requests/along-route
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": [
    { "lat": 50.0614, "lng": 19.9366 }
  ],
  "bufferMeters": 500
}
